MintCurveConvexPosition::initialize(address,address,address,MintCurveConvexConfig)
├── when _factory is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
├── when _market is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
├── when _owner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── when borrow token is not a coin in the configured Curve pool
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
└── when _owner, _factory and _market are valid
    ├── it should set factory to _factory
    ├── it should set market to _market
    ├── it should set owner to _owner
    ├── it should snapshot config on the position
    ├── it should set borrowToken to market.borrowToken()
    ├── given borrow token is coin0 of the Curve pool
    │   └── it should set indexOfBorrowTokenInPool to 0
    ├── given borrow token is coin1 of the Curve pool
    │   └── it should set indexOfBorrowTokenInPool to 1
    ├── it should emit OwnershipTransferred
    ├── it should initialize AuthUpgradeable for the position
    └── it should not allow re-initialization
